Actor Ahmed Ali Akbar celebrated his birthday surrounded by his wife Maham Batool, family and close friends, with the intimate gathering featuring playful d&eacute;cor and plenty of personal touches.
Batool took to Instagram to share a series of pictures from her husband&rsquo;s special day, giving followers a glimpse into the carefully curated celebration. From quirky decorations to candid moments with friends, the birthday bash appeared to be every bit as fun and personal as the couple&rsquo;s style.
&ldquo;When the theme is birthday,&rdquo; she wrote in one of her posts, perfectly capturing the mood of the celebration.
The d&eacute;cor was particularly eye-catching, featuring cut-outs of Akbar&rsquo;s face sporting different hats, whimsical paper banners, balloons, flowers and long candles. The actor&rsquo;s face even made an appearance on burgers, while cute table lamps and fairy lights gave the venue a warm, playful feel.
In another picture, Batool shared a sweet photograph of herself smiling at Akbar as the two looked at each other affectionately. &ldquo;To many more years of you, my fav guy,&rdquo; she wrote.
